{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Hand-Crafted Halloween World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a bullethell adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/4f08f1267abb1208b8151a4e83ae7c32.poster.avif?t=1768424236\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/4f08f1267abb1208b8151a4e83ae7c32.webm?t=1768424236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/4f08f1267abb1208b8151a4e83ae7c32.mp4?t=1768424236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Grumpy Jack</i> is brought to life in rich, detailed 2D animation, filled with strange creatures, forgotten corners, and unexpected charm. Every area feels unique, with something new to learn or stumble into around each bend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/45946c95869f9b4ed6b9f092942b531a.poster.avif?t=1768424236\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/45946c95869f9b4ed6b9f092942b531a.webm?t=1768424236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/45946c95869f9b4ed6b9f092942b531a.mp4?t=1768424236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll meet quirky characters, unlock a wide range of skills, and piece together a story full of dry humor and odd surprises. Whether you're solving a puzzle, dodging a trap, or helping a skeleton with a strange request, there's always something weird and worth chasing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/7f256f847514544001fd2331d6711292.poster.avif?t=1768424236\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/7f256f847514544001fd2331d6711292.webm?t=1768424236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/7f256f847514544001fd2331d6711292.mp4?t=1768424236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like classic top-down gameplay, oddball adventures, and a world that doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously, <i>Grumpy Jack</i> is ready to welcome you in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/9a48ae9baf199adf256dd7d0c5a76f6a.poster.avif?t=1768424236\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/9a48ae9baf199adf256dd7d0c5a76f6a.webm?t=1768424236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/9a48ae9baf199adf256dd7d0c5a76f6a.mp4?t=1768424236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large, interconnected world with Metroidvania-style progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down bullethell action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn and master a wide variety of skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humorous story full of odd surprises and bizarre characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five difficulty modes, from relaxed to relentless</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D art and animation in a unique Halloween-inspired setting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/d1ba098a9d10c7727bb5aad78c97f37c.poster.avif?t=1768424236\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/d1ba098a9d10c7727bb5aad78c97f37c.webm?t=1768424236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/d1ba098a9d10c7727bb5aad78c97f37c.mp4?t=1768424236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698230?t=1768424236","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698230?t=1768424236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/d6092a9b1cb10510e34aa9a8bdfedb524f4b9006/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768424236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/d6092a9b1cb10510e34aa9a8bdfedb524f4b9006/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768424236","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Hand-Crafted Halloween World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a bullethell adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cl